{"data":{"id":"VDNUOyCR4_0","slug":"high-klassified","title":"High Klassified","artwork":null,"tracks":[{"id":"B_smu2ty7ZE","slug":"hyrule-kastle","title":"Hyrule Kastle"},{"id":"xympd_nxGNc","slug":"broken-elbows","title":"broken elbows"},{"id":"SbAWnq6kgt8","slug":"okarina-of-time","title":"Okarina of Time"},{"id":"B4AXwQrxZU4","slug":"pale-rose-remix","title":"PALE ROSE (Remix)"},{"id":"s0mmK0uo1zA","slug":"1250","title":"1250"},{"id":"kAtl1Y-yksU","slug":"kefka","title":"Kefka"},{"id":"kNxiL9VhwzA","slug":"luxury","title":"Luxury"},{"id":"wHFfi1EQrjM","slug":"ns-bounce-feat-da-p","title":"NS Bounce (feat. Da-P)"}]},"markers":[{"id":"Mdnx6p3ZNfQ","position":33,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"High Klassified - Luxury","track":{"id":"kNxiL9VhwzA","path":"/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury/","slug":"luxury","title":"Luxury","artist":{"slug":"high-klassified","title":"High Klassified"},"artwork":"images/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"zg_8tfPfypk","slug":"144","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-144-w"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #144 w/ starRo","artwork":"/images/episodes/144.jpg","content":"\nstarRo hails all the way from Tokyo, Japan to play original productions and edits.\n\n<!--more-->\n\nThere have been so many guests on Soulection Radio over the past years but no one, we repeat, no one has came in the studio so humble, so low key and just murk the airwaves like starRo did. \nIt's crazy to think that this man has been making music for over 15 years and is barely coming to surface to the world with so much heat. \nWe are just glad he is on our team. He played nothing but original production/edits. \nHailing all the way from Tokyo, Japan, starRo is an artist who you will be familiar with starting from this point on. \nJoe Kay of course opened the show for the first hour & 50 minutes on one turntable (one of the turntable's went out before the show started) playing a bunch of heat that he was holding onto since last week. \nHe made sure to make up for his absence last saturday and play some exclusive Carmack, Atu, Kaytra, Esta, Esgar, Jo Def + some other heavy footwork vibes.\n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10812,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-09-14T00:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"8I6ru079tG8","position":28,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"High Klassified - Luxury","track":{"id":"kNxiL9VhwzA","path":"/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury/","slug":"luxury","title":"Luxury","artist":{"slug":"high-klassified","title":"High Klassified"},"artwork":"images/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"U3ckiXHBqgw","slug":"147","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-147-w-dj"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #147 w/ DJ Nobody","artwork":"/images/episodes/147.jpg","content":"We have Low End Theory's very own DJ Nobody in the studio with us. \n\n<!--more-->\nWe hope you're ready for not just another great session of musical selections but also a great 25+ minute discussion between DJ Nobody and Joe Kay. \nJoe kicked things off for a little over an hour & 33 minutes with new and forgotten gems. \n\nDo your research! Nobody made his 1st appearance on the show that was well overdue and went into a heavy/experimental beat journey ranging a variety of BPM's. \nWe discussed a bit of his background and really got into the history of Low End Theory and the progression of where it is today. \nNobody discussed crucial experiences that you would want to know so listen closely. \n\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10811,"location":"US","published_at":"2013-10-05T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Set","position":0}},{"id":"eKw7rm_SiU4","position":18,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"High Klassified - Hyrule Kastle","track":{"id":"B_smu2ty7ZE","path":"/artists/high-klassified/tracks/hyrule-kastle/","slug":"hyrule-kastle","title":"Hyrule Kastle","artist":{"slug":"high-klassified","title":"High Klassified"},"artwork":"images/artists/high-klassified/tracks/hyrule-kastle.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"-o3R3MpGKew","slug":"175","tags":[1,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-175-special-announcement"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #175 (Rinse FM Announcement)","artwork":"/images/episodes/175.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) & [iiike](https://soundcloud.com/iiike) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10894,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-06-14T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"4BNFjB8jZaE","position":55,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"High Klassified - Luxury","track":{"id":"kNxiL9VhwzA","path":"/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury/","slug":"luxury","title":"Luxury","artist":{"slug":"high-klassified","title":"High Klassified"},"artwork":"images/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury.jpg"},"chapter":{"show":{"id":"dmevNeYyuRE","slug":"179","tags":[8,3,15],"links":{"soundcloud":"https://soundcloud.com/soulection/soulection-radio-show-179"},"state":"published","title":"Soulection Radio Show #179","artwork":"/images/episodes/179.jpg","content":"\n<!--more-->\n\nThanks to [true listener^^](https://soundcloud.com/true_listener) for supplying this tracklist.\n","profile":"QiEFFErt688","duration":10740,"location":"US","published_at":"2014-07-12T01:00:00+00:00"},"title":"Joe Kay's Session","position":0}},{"id":"SCd9pvjJviM","position":0,"timestamp":null,"rawTrack":"High Klassified - Luxury","track":{"id":"kNxiL9VhwzA","path":"/artists/high-klassified/tracks/luxury/","slug":"